1
00:00:00,349 --> 00:00:03,489
(Raj:)My name is Little
Orphan Annie.

2
00:00:03,486 --> 00:00:05,356
(Howard:)You killed my father.

3
00:00:05,355 --> 00:00:07,725
(Howard:)Prepare to die.

4
00:00:09,825 --> 00:00:12,965
(with accent):
My name is Darth Vader.

5
00:00:12,962 --> 00:00:16,062
I am your father. Ah!

6
00:00:17,766 --> 00:00:20,066
(Sheldon:)This is fun.
Good.

7
00:00:20,069 --> 00:00:22,099
(Leonard:)It's nice
to see your mind off Amy.

8
00:00:22,104 --> 00:00:23,534
(Barry:)What's going on with Amy?

9
00:00:23,539 --> 00:00:25,209
(Sheldon:)Not that it's any
of your business,

10
00:00:25,208 --> 00:00:26,608
(Sheldon:)but she broke up with me.

11
00:00:26,609 --> 00:00:28,109
(Penny:)Really?

12
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,810
(Barry:)Good to know.

13
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,780
"Good to know"?

14
00:00:33,783 --> 00:00:35,613
(Sheldon:)What's that supposed to mean?
Oh.

15
00:00:35,618 --> 00:00:38,818
(Leonard:)I hate to say it, but it sounds
like he's interested in her.

16
00:00:38,821 --> 00:00:41,851
(Sheldon:)Well, that's unacceptable.

17
00:00:41,857 --> 00:00:44,027
(Leonard:)Oh, buddy, I get
that you don't like it,

18
00:00:44,026 --> 00:00:45,856
(Leonard:)but it's not
really up to you.

19
00:00:45,861 --> 00:00:49,031
(Sheldon:)Yeah, but he's dumb,
and his face is dumb.

20
00:00:49,031 --> 00:00:52,301
(Leonard:)Look, even if it's not him,

21
00:00:52,301 --> 00:00:55,801
(Leonard:)Amy's probably going
to date someone at some point.

22
00:00:55,804 --> 00:00:57,434
(Sheldon:)You really think so?

23
00:00:57,439 --> 00:01:00,109
(Leonard:)Of course.
She deserves to be happy.

